        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Another tommy store with all the discounts you like BUT the EMPLOYEES here are way more friendly and nice than any other place. Thank you keep it up.",
        "time": 1742937188,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Greisy Andreina Castillo",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107515467441043229712/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIlWfV-zyUiZtdvosTmuyvWFonKdfIe0hlVXETtkxyzVUgk5w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Very disappointed. I spent a long time selecting clothes, and when I went to the changing room, they were closed. I looked for an assistant, and she told me they couldn't open it because they were about to close. There were 10 minutes left until closing time, and they wouldn't let me try anything on. I wasted my time selecting clothes. On the other hand, the clothes were nice and the prices were good.",
        "time": 1751200468,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sameh Kamel",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115301498660105723152/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKh3s57RU0EmSDmIABAhftMnaW_RygQhyw5qyGDyiVy4gafVQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I have been dealing with this branch for more than 10 years and my experience in general is that they are not helpful. Today I was exchanging a t-shirt that I bought yesterday with same model but different color and they insisted to convince me that the system did not accept so I need to pay a difference in price which is not logic. This is not the main problem. The real issue is that you always  feel they are not trying to help you or take your side. Sometimes they even turn to be aggressive and rude. Anyway, this is my experience and hope they can change their attitude and culture because seems all the latest reviews are complaining from same behavior.",
        "time": 1719700571,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Karl Boule",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108144561424365219366/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUJMMKA7n-TiBqZbJSvO23NusfWVJwGqSHM80axcegMLqNP_KEB=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "11 months ago",
        "text": "Beautiful clothes and store. Great service and good prices. Especially AUDREY she was patient and helpful. Great experience, thank you.",
